{
  "_comment": [
    "MOH-wide O3 runtime configuration. Loaded after config-core.json and before the",
    "programme and site layers, so it overrides core and is overridden by site.",
    "Must be listed in SPA_CONFIG_URLS — see IMPLEMENTATION.md §7."
  ],
  "_comment_service_queues": [
    "concepts MUST be set. Every key below has a built-in default in",
    "esm-service-queues-app pointing at a RefApp demo concept that does not exist in this",
    "database, and the app sends those UUIDs straight to the backend — queue-entry?status=",
    "<uuid> then answers 500 'Unable to find concept' and the dashboard renders an error.",
    "Leaving the block empty is NOT the same as leaving it unset: the defaults still apply."
  ],
  "@openmrs/esm-service-queues-app": {
    "defaultInitialServiceQueue": "TB Screening",
    "concepts": {
      "defaultStatusConceptUuid": "${var.concept.ciel.queue-waiting.uuid}",
      "defaultTransitionStatus": "${var.concept.ciel.queue-in-progress.uuid}",
      "defaultPriorityConceptUuid": "${var.concept.national.queue-routine.uuid}",
      "emergencyPriorityConceptUuid": "${var.concept.ciel.queue-emergency.uuid}"
    }
  },
  "_comment_home_dashboards": [
    "LE-395. /home opens the dashboard defaultDashboardPerRole names for one of the user's roles,",
    "else 'service-queues', else the first dashboard left in homepage-dashboard-slot. Each",
    "dashboard below is shown only to a user holding EVERY privilege its data needs, so no role",
    "lands on, or sees a link to, a dashboard that can only answer 403.",
    "LE-397. The national roles land on their own app's dashboard, which the app registers in",
    "homepage-dashboard-slot gated by the same privilege as its page (routes.json): audit-log",
    "(View Audit Log), indicator-reports (Export National Report), sync-status (View Sync Status),",
    "sync-conflicts (Resolve Sync Conflicts). A name whose dashboard is missing (an app build",
    "older than LE-397) falls back to the first dashboard left, as before. A user with several",
    "mapped roles lands on the first of them in the session's role order.",
    "Privilege names: docs/security/moh-ict-sop-mapping.md, 'The login roles'."
  ],
  "@openmrs/esm-home-app": {
    "defaultDashboardPerRole": {
      "National Reporting Officer": "indicator-reports",
      "Sync Administrator": "sync-status",
      "ICT Auditor": "audit-log",
      "Sync Conflict Reviewer": "sync-conflicts"
    },
    "extensionSlots": {
      "homepage-dashboard-slot": {
        "configure": {
          "service-queues-dashboard-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["Get Queues", "Get Queue Entries", "Get Visits"] }
          },
          "clinical-appointments-dashboard-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["View Appointments"] }
          },
          "laboratory-dashboard-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["Get Orders", "Get Patients"] }
          },
          "billing-dashboard-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["View Cashier Bills"] }
          },
          "ward-dashboard-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["Get Beds", "Get Admission Locations", "Assign Beds"] }
          },
          "patient-lists-dashboard-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["Get Patient Cohorts"] }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "_comment_app_menu": [
    "LE-397. The RefApp's app menu entries carry no privilege of their own, so every signed-in user",
    "saw them, the national roles included. Each is shown only to a user holding what its page",
    "needs: System Administration the legacy admin's View Administration Functions, the queue",
    "screen the same queue privileges as the service queues dashboard, Dispensing Get Medication",
    "Dispense (the Pharmacist). LiberiaEMR's own entries are gated in their routes.json."
  ],
  "@openmrs/esm-primary-navigation-app": {
    "extensionSlots": {
      "app-menu-slot": {
        "configure": {
          "system-administration-app-menu-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["View Administration Functions"] }
          },
          "queue-screen-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["Get Queues", "Get Queue Entries", "Get Visits"] }
          },
          "dispensing-link": {
            "Display conditions": { "privileges": ["Get Medication Dispense"] }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-app-shell": {
    "Enabled feature flags": [
      "patient-flags"
    ]
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-patient-label-printing-app": {
    "_comment": [
      "The banner's Actions > Print identifier sticker prints it."
    ],
    "showPrintIdentifierStickerButton": true
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-patient-registration-app": {
    "defaultPatientIdentifierTypes": [
      "${var.identifiertype.moh-health-record.uuid}",
      "${var.identifiertype.national-id.uuid}"
    ],
    "sections": [
      "demographics",
      "contact",
      "referralDetails",
      "relationships"
    ],
    "sectionDefinitions": [
      {
        "id": "referralDetails",
        "name": "Referral Details",
        "fields": [
          "purposeOfVisit",
          "referredFrom",
          "referredBy",
          "referralRefNumber",
          "dateOfReferral",
          "reasonForReferral"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "contact",
        "name": "Contact Details",
        "fields": [
          "address",
          "telephoneNumber"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "fieldDefinitions": [
      {
        "id": "purposeOfVisit",
        "type": "person attribute",
        "uuid": "${var.personattribute.purpose-of-visit.uuid}",
        "label": "Purpose of Visit",
        "placeholder": "Purpose of Visit"
      },
      {
        "id": "referredFrom",
        "type": "person attribute",
        "uuid": "${var.personattribute.referred-from.uuid}",
        "label": "Referred from",
        "placeholder": "Referred from details"
      },
      {
        "id": "referredBy",
        "type": "person attribute",
        "uuid": "${var.personattribute.referred-by.uuid}",
        "label": "Referred by",
        "placeholder": "Referred by"
      },
      {
        "id": "referralRefNumber",
        "type": "person attribute",
        "uuid": "${var.personattribute.referral-ref-number.uuid}",
        "label": "Referral reference number",
        "placeholder": "1234567"
      },
      {
        "id": "dateOfReferral",
        "type": "obs",
        "uuid": "${var.concept.date-of-referral.uuid}",
        "label": "Date of Referral",
        "placeholder": "Select Date",
        "validation": {
          "required": false
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "reasonForReferral",
        "type": "person attribute",
        "uuid": "${var.personattribute.reason-for-referral.uuid}",
        "label": "Reason for referral",
        "placeholder": "Reason for referral"
      },
      {
        "id": "telephoneNumber",
        "type": "person attribute",
        "uuid": "${var.personattributetypes.telephone-number.uuid}",
        "label": "Telephone Number",
        "validation": {
          "required": true
        }
      }
    ],
    "fieldConfigurations": {
      "name": {
        "displayMiddleName": true
      },
      "phone": {
        "personAttributeUuid": "${var.personattributetypes.telephone-number.uuid}",
        "validation": {
          "required": true
        }
      },
      "address": {
        "useAddressHierarchy": {
          "enabled": true,
          "useQuickSearch": true,
          "searchAddressByLevel": true
        }
      },
      "gender": [
        {
          "value": "male",
          "label": "Male"
        },
        {
          "value": "female",
          "label": "Female"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "@liberiaemr/esm-liberia-login-app": {
    "_comment_idle_timeout": [
      "Minutes of human inactivity for the login-app watcher. Maven filtering leaves this as a string such as \"10\".",
      "This is not logoutIdleTimeoutMinutes. See docs/security/moh-ict-sop-mapping.md."
    ],
    "session": {
      "idleTimeoutMinutes": "${var.security.session.timeout-minutes}"
    }
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-styleguide": {
    "Brand color #1": "#002A86",
    "Brand color #2": "#001B56",
    "Brand color #3": "#002A86"
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-patient-forms-app": {
    "customFormsUrl": "/ws/rest/v1/liberiaemr/forms?patientUuid=${patientUuid}",
    "orderBy": "name",
    "formSections": [
      {
        "name": "TB Forms",
        "forms": [
          "TB Screening"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Triage",
        "forms": [
          "Triage Form",
          "OPD Consultation Form"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Labor and Delivery",
        "forms": [
          "1. First and Second Stage of Labor and Delivery",
          "2. Partograph",
          "3. Third Stage of Labor and Delivery",
          "4. Fourth Stage Monitoring for Woman and Baby"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Maternal and Reproductive Health",
        "forms": [
          "ANC Initial Visit",
          "ANC Follow-up Visit",
          "Mother PNC",
          "Newborn PNC",
          "3. Family Planning"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Immunization",
        "forms": [
          "Immunization",
          "Adverse Event Following Immunization (AEFI)"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-billing-app": {
    "defaultCurrency": "LRD",
    "_comment_logo": [
      "Printed invoice header. With logo.src and logo.alt both empty the app draws the OpenMRS"
    ],
    "logo": {
      "src": "${openmrsSpaBase}/branding/moh-liberia-seal.svg",
      "alt": "Ministry of Health, Republic of Liberia"
    },
    "country": "Republic of Liberia"
  },
  "@openmrs/esm-patient-chart-app": {
    "showServiceQueueFields": true,
    "extensionSlots": {
      "patient-chart-summary-dashboard-slot": {
        "add": [],
        "order": [
          "patient-flags-list",
          "liberia-obs-widget",
          "vitals-overview-widget",
          "biometrics-overview-widget",
          "conditions-overview-widget",
          "active-medications-widget",
          "future-medications-widget",
          "past-medications-widget"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "_comment_reports": [
    "MOH indicator report runner (LE-335). reportUuids is the list offered, in this order;",
    "a report left out is not shown. Set here, not in config-central.json: central loads this",
    "layer too, and the app reads its facility or central role from the reports module at",
    "runtime. mflCodeAttributeTypeUuid lets the central picker find a facility by MFL code."
  ],
  "@liberiaemr/esm-liberia-reports-app": {
    "reportUuids": [
      "${var.report.rmncah.uuid}",
      "${var.report.nutrition.uuid}",
      "${var.report.malaria.uuid}",
      "${var.report.ncd.uuid}",
      "${var.report.emr-ops.uuid}"
    ],
    "mflCodeAttributeTypeUuid": "${var.locationattributetype.mfl-code.uuid}"
  },
  "liberia-obs-widget": {
    "displayMode": "table",
    "title": "TB Screening",
    "encounterTypes": [
      "${var.encountertype.tb-screening.uuid}"
    ],
    "formUuid": "${var.form.tb-screening.uuid}",
    "data": [
      {
        "concept": "${var.concept.national.coughing-2-weeks-or-more.uuid}",
        "label": "Cough > 2 wks"
      },
      {
        "concept": "${var.concept.national.night-sweats.uuid}",
        "label": "Night Sweats"
      },
      {
        "concept": "${var.concept.national.weight-loss.uuid}",
        "label": "Weight Loss"
      },
      {
        "concept": "${var.concept.national.fever.uuid}",
        "label": "Fever"
      },
      {
        "concept": "${var.concept.national.swelling-in-any-part-of-the-body.uuid}",
        "label": "Swelling"
      },
      {
        "concept": "${var.concept.national.total-score.uuid}",
        "label": "Total Score"
      }
    ]
  }
}
